{"unit_id":"nineberg__dsh-plugin-stock#card-zh","repo":"nineberg/dsh-plugin-stock","commit":"40296876fff39fc19d4fc5cce64986cf10cd15db","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"投资标的是面向 DSH 网页客户端的证券行情插件，在侧栏提供行情面板，并可把侧栏入口拖出为悬浮窗。它通过主机端同源接口读取东方财富的行情、分时和五日走势数据，支持沪深、港股和美股代码；面板可搜索、添加和删除标的，并切换分时或五日视图。悬浮窗显示同一标的列表，可拖动、收起或停靠，也能通过拖放协议接入插件灵动岛。适合希望在 DSH 会话旁查看关注证券行情的用户。无需 API 密钥，默认标的和刷新间隔可配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2088-2119","index.js:468-476","client.js:1812-1880"]}
{"unit_id":"nineberg__dsh-plugin-stock#card-en","repo":"nineberg/dsh-plugin-stock","commit":"40296876fff39fc19d4fc5cce64986cf10cd15db","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Symbol Trends adds a DSH web sidebar for live A-share, Hong Kong, and US quotes with intraday and five-day trends. Search and edit a watchlist, or tear it off into a movable widget that docks with the sidebar or Plugin Island. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2088-2119","index.js:468-476","client.js:1812-1880"]}
